        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ui): scroll truncated sidebar session names on hover",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nLong session titles in the Control UI sidebar's recent-sessions list are clipped, and users cannot read the hidden tail without opening the session or waiting for the native tooltip. Titles that share a long prefix become hard to distinguish.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nHovering a truncated session row now slides the label to reveal its hidden tail, then restores the normal ellipsis when the pointer leaves. The row is explicitly allowed to shrink inside the sidebar so overflow is measured on the label itself. Animation distance and duration come from the live rendered width, reduced-motion users keep the static ellipsis, and each rendered row is keyed by session id so an in-progress animation cannot leak when active and recent sessions reshuffle.\n\nThe final regression coverage runs against the real mocked Control UI and Gateway flow rather than a standalone synthetic row. It verifies actual sidebar layout, hover movement, mid-animation session selection, row-state reset, and reduced motion.\n\n## User Impact\n\nDesktop users can hover a truncated recent-session name to read the full title. Labels that fit remain static, reduced-motion behavior remains static, and selecting a session during the animation cannot shift another session's label.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Rest (ellipsis preserved): ![rest](https://github.com/steipete/openclaw-pr-assets/releases/download/sidebar-hover-marquee/marquee-rest.png)\n- Mid-scroll on hover: ![mid](https://github.com/steipete/openclaw-pr-assets/releases/download/sidebar-hover-marquee/marquee-mid.png)\n- End of scroll (tail visible): ![end](https://github.com/steipete/openclaw-pr-assets/releases/download/sidebar-hover-marquee/marquee-end.png)\n- Red proof on Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kwsj6b06xagsea6akasa4mms`: without keyed row ownership, selecting the hovered session left the reshuffled short row at `text-indent: -5.33328px`.\n- `pnpm test ui/src/lib/hover-marquee.test.ts ui/src/e2e/chat-flow.e2e.test.ts` — 4 helper tests and all 21 mocked Control UI chat E2E tests passed on the same Testbox.\n- `pnpm check:changed` — passed on the same Testbox in 8m11s (typecheck, lint, and guards).\n- Codex autoreview (`gpt-5.5`, high reasoning): clean, no accepted/actionable findings.\n",
